## Hard constraints

- Includes + `asyncEach`/`ifAsync` for anything with `{% image %}` / `{% svg %}`
- Theme names are colors (`gray-dark`, `teal`), never `dark`/`light`/`default`/`accent` for section surfaces
- Full-bleed bg on `.section`, not `.section__inner`
- CTA theme defaults in `button.css` (blocks layer)
